# Talkman QCA6174 Rome UART leftover (MATCH bluetooth*.te).
# Userspace stack is HIDL android.hardware.bluetooth@1.0-impl + CAF
# libbt-vendor. UART is /dev/ttyHS0 (hal_bluetooth + start_hci_filter /
# wcnss_filter). BD_ADDR is persist /persist/bdaddr.txt or QCA OTP
# (USE_CONTROLLER_BDADDR, init.talkman.bt.sh zeros tag 2). Do not
# generate a MAC here. Leftover bullhead BCM4358 / btnvtool / kgsl
# debugfs is not this SoC — bluetooth domain does not walk GPU.

# persist read for BD_ADDR is hal_bluetooth (not this domain).
